    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71689" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξῠλᾰμ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plant</i> or <i>sow,</i> usu. of green crops or
			fodder (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπείρω</span> of cereals),
			mostly c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. χόρτῳ, χλωροῖς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				499.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.315.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1629.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span> ; but also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. κριθήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					85.21
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>.</div>
